# Opt-in test targets with no CI caller, each owned by the quest that gives it
# one: `<kind> <name> <quest>`. sh/gh/test-inventory.py prints the name of any
# orphan missing here, and fails on an entry that has a caller.

# Need a GPU, a desktop, or a device that no CI runner has.
ignore moq-carla-bridge::gpu_video_reaches_the_worker /quest/m2/carla-bridge.md
